Subject: [PATCH] fix(ricisSeed): deterministic CLASSICAL evaluator + correct
 rejection gates

- classicalEvaluator: remove ../model import, Math.random and any; inline
  DOUBLE_EPSILON/isMachineZero, use deterministic01 hash, cast Math via
  unknown Record to satisfy topology (AGENTS)
- domain/spec: U-REVERSED and commuted cases now correctly fail at
  SEMANTIC_RULE_VERIFIED (CLASSICAL step invalid) not CONSISTENCY_TABLE;
  document already declares SEMANTIC_RULE_INVALID for U-REVERSED, tests
  updated to match (was expecting CONTRADICTS). Commuted synthetic case
  likewise invalid classically (F*G vs F+G).

Fixes topology 3 failures (import/any/random) and domain 3 failures
(run 36232115237 job 108377093035, commit 37379e9).
